            "review_title": "Review at Phuoc Thai Restaurant",
            "review_text": "hetic\nSingapore, Singapore14 contributions\n1\nPathetic Portions and Service Quality. Cant speak English at all.\nDec 2019 • Family\nWas recommended to visit by a friend. This was the 2nd seafood restaurant we tried in Da Nang but we left being very disappointed. \n\n1) We ordered 2 kg of Oysters but we suspect it was only about 1.5kg. We kind of know because we ordered 2 kg worth at another restaurant. Oysters were quite small.\n \n2) Staffs cant speak English and do not come to you. We had to stand at the seafood tank area for 15 minutes and wave continuously like mad men to the staff before they attended to us. A staff even ignored us twice even with eye contact. \n\n3) They forgot our order. After waiting 20 minutes, we decided to forego it when the same waiter whom we ordered from, reminded the staff to bring our food over. This only took 3 minutes.\n\n4) Seasoning was quite bland. You can pay similar prices for better.\n\n5) We ordered clams. I suspect it was cooked in bulk and meat dropped out. Most of our clams had no meat. Refer to picture. We started by putting empty shells aside.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 15, 2019",
